# Ignore everything sbrushc drops into generated/ EXCEPT the checked-in C++
# brush kernel headers (*.brush.gen.h). Those are committed so cross-compile
# builds (WASM/CI) can consume them without building the native sbrushc host
# tool — see sbrushCodegen() in make.mjs (SBRUSH_SKIP_NATIVE_CODEGEN).
/generated/*
!/generated/*.brush.gen.h
